        "sha": "2ed8ec9de79d14248537683d94f0c9159924a579",
        "message": "apps/examples/: Add crashrpt_test application for crash diagnostic capture\n\nAdd crashrpt_test example application that demonstrates the /dev/crashrpt\ndriver functionality. The application allocates diagnostic data structures\n(500 nodes of 48 bytes, 50 nodes of 64 bytes) and registers a reporter\nthread that serializes all data to a file when the system asserts.\n\nThe reporter runs at high priority and uses atomic file operations\n(write to temp file + rename) to ensure reports are never partially written."
